// ---- saturation anchors (SPEC 13.12; Inverse.anchorModel / anchorPx): z = p + delta near p = (+-1 - B) / A (tan: +-i).
// Per anchor a, uAnc[4a..4a+3] = model (type 0 none / 1 sure / 2 cone / 3 circle, its radius m, flag, sgn), geometry
